ens-normalize.js is dist/index.mjs of @adraffy/ens-normalize 1.11.1 (https://github.com/adraffy/ens-normalize.js),
unchanged: the npm tarball's sha512 is nhCBV3quEgesuf7c7KYfperqSS14T8bYuvJ8PcLJp6znkZpFc0AuW4qBtr8eKVyPPe/8RSr7sglCWPU5eaxwKQ==.
It is the build viem uses for ENS names, so reply senders are checked as ethchat checks them.

